### 0. 서버 헬스체크
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health

###

### 1. 사용자가 특정 마트(이마트/홈플러스/롯데마트) 전단 정보 요청 (1순위 공식 소스)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/flyers/source?martId=store-emart-yeoksam

###

### 2 & 3. Supabase 이미지 URL을 백엔드로 직접 전달하여 Gemini Bounding Box 검출
POST http://localhost:4000/api/flyers/detect-boxes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542838132-92c53300491e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
  "martName": "이마트"
}

###

### 4. [웹워커 시뮬레이션] Bounding Box 좌표 목록에 여백(Padding)을 주고 크롭 시뮬레이션
POST http://localhost:4000/api/flyers/simulate-worker-crop
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542838132-92c53300491e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
  "paddingPercent": 5,
  "boxes": [
    { "id": "box-1", "ymin": 100, "xmin": 50, "ymax": 450, "xmax": 480, "labelHint": "한돈 삼겹살" },
    { "id": "box-2", "ymin": 100, "xmin": 520, "ymax": 450, "xmax": 950, "labelHint": "다우니 섬유유연제" }
  ]
}

###

### 5. 웹워커에서 크롭된 상품 이미지(Base64 또는 Blob)를 Vercel 백엔드로 넘겨 Gemini JSON 파싱
POST http://localhost:4000/api/flyers/parse-product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "martName": "이마트",
  "imageBase64": "data:image/jpeg;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg=="
}

###

### 6. 기존 마트 3사 최저가 비교 조회 API
GET http://localhost:4000/api/products/compare

###

### 7. [신규] 마스터 전단 1차 파싱 (Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite TSV + Groq GPT-OSS-20B Grounding 팁)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/flyers/parse-master
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "martName": "이마트",
  "imageUrls": [
    "https://lottemartgo-prod-bucket.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/leaflet/1789456778396.jpg",
    "https://lottemartgo-prod-bucket.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/leaflet/1789456778402.jpg",
    "https://lottemartgo-prod-bucket.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/leaflet/1789456778411.jpg",
    "https://lottemartgo-prod-bucket.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/leaflet/1789456778417.jpg"
  ]
}

###

### 8. [신규] 지점 전단 페이지 차분 & 동기화 (Page-Diff & Single-Page Replacement)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/flyers/sync-branch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "martName": "이마트",
  "branchName": "이마트 청주점",
  "masterProducts": [
    {
      "id": "prod-1",
      "pageIndex": 1,
      "productName": "국내산 삼겹살 100g",
      "salePrice": 1980,
      "effectiveUnitPrice": 1980,
      "unitMeasure": "100g",
      "isPerishable": true
    },
    {
      "id": "prod-2",
      "pageIndex": 2,
      "productName": "다우니 섬유유연제 1L",
      "salePrice": 7900,
      "effectiveUnitPrice": 790,
      "unitMeasure": "100ml",
      "isPerishable": false
    }
  ],
  "masterPageUrls": [
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542838132-92c53300491e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578916171728-46686eac8d58?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
  ],
  "branchPageUrls": [
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542838132-92c53300491e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578916171728-46686eac8d58?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
  ]
}
